libduckdb-sys (vendored, modified)

This directory is a modified copy of the crate `libduckdb-sys` 1.10504.0
(crates.io), originally MIT-licensed by DuckDB Labs and contributors. The
upstream LICENSE file is kept unchanged.

Modifications made for pADA:

- build.rs: no download, no bindgen, no DuckDB compilation. It copies the
  pre-generated bindings (src/bindgen_bundled_version.rs) to $OUT_DIR and
  emits link directives for a prebuilt DuckDB static library located via
  DUCKDB_LIB_DIR or <repo>/duckdb-cache/<target>/.
- Cargo.toml: all [build-dependencies] removed (unused by the patched
  build.rs); feature names are kept as empty features because the `duckdb`
  crate enables them by name.
- Removed files: src/bindgen_bundled_version_loadable.rs, wrapper.h,
  wrapper_ext.h, Cargo.toml.orig, .cargo_vcs_info.json, .cargo-ok.
- Removed the crate-internal test modules.
